  "originalQuery": "Your company operates an e-commerce application with customers primarily located in Japan. There are no compliance restrictions mandating that data must be stored in Japan or the Asia region. You plan to use Cloud SQL as the database. To ensure the application is performant for your users, which region should you choose to create the database instance?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Create the instance in a Google Cloud region in Japan.<br/>B. Create the instance in us-central1, Iowa, as it supports the largest number of zones.<br/>C. Create the instance in the asia-southeast1 region in Singapore.<br/>D. Create the instance in a Google Cloud region in the United States.",
